/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 66 0 R
/E (The practical was carried out in Zoho Creator using the Job Application Form application. The application is used for managing job applications, and it served as the practical environment for exploring the security and governance features described in this record. The Zoho Creator account was on a trial \(the footer shows "Trial expires in 4 days" with an Upgrade option\), so some advanced features may depend on an upgrade; no upgrade-only feature is claimed as configured in this record. )
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
81 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 66 0 R
/E (Security and governance in low-code applications deal with controlling who can use an application, what each person is permitted to do, and how the data and resources of the application are administered. Because low-code platforms make it easy to build applications that store business data, controlling access to that data is an important part of application design. )
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
